  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Infraestructura Vial II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Road Infrastructure Program II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es (i) apoyar al financiamiento de la DNV en la conservacin de la red vial a su cargo, a la vez que se desarrollan sus capacidades tcnicas e institucionales; (ii) mejorar las condiciones de seguridad vial en la red interurbana; y (iii) contribuir al aumento de la participacin del modo ferroviario en la matriz de cargas, mediante la reforma de la estructura institucional vigente.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is as follows: (i) to support DNV financing of maintenance of the road system under its jurisdiction, while developing the DNVs technical and institutional capacities; (ii) to improve road safety conditions in the interurban road system; and (iii) to help raise the railway systems share of the cargo matrix by altering the current institutional structure.</narrative>
  </description>
